# Never copy host dependencies, generated outputs or secrets into build stages.
**/node_modules
**/.git
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/dist-*
**/build
**/.next
**/coverage
**/.cache
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env*
# A host-generated Prisma client (another platform's engine, its completion
# record, leftover temp engines) must not enter the image; the build generates.
packages/database/generated
packages/database/.test-fixtures
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/vite.config.js
**/vite.config.d.ts
